constructor
  ├── it should set the vault
  ├── it should set the chain selector reported by the vault
  ├── it should grant DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to defaultAdmin
  ├── it should grant PAUSER_ROLE to pauser
  ├── it should grant UNPAUSER_ROLE to unpauser
  ├── it should grant CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE to configOperator
  ├── it should grant KEYSTONE_FORWARDER_ROLE to keystoneForwarder
  ├── when pauser is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when unpauser is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when config operator is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when keystone forwarder is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when vault is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroAddress
  └── when the vault reports a zero chain selector
      └── it should revert with WorkflowRouter__NoZeroChainSelector
